{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Official Release</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More types of monsters will be updated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More types of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional game storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More diverse random map events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam leaderboard system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rosttle is an independently developed 2D top-down shooter. In each round, the player must survive as long as possible, collect the yellow energy dots scattered around the field, avoid map obstacles, and use every means to eliminate monsters, earn coins, and receive rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every weapon comes with a special passive ability; combining different firearms yields distinct playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced combat with gradually increasing difficulty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Independently developed, with long-term update support planned for the future</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Passive Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, the passive effects of items interact with each other. By adjusting their positions in your inventory according to their properties, you can achieve a &quot;greater than the sum of its parts&quot; effect that makes your character even more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/extras/\u88ab\u52a8\u4ea4\u4e92\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c_1920_1080.gif?t=1742539536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Randomly Generated Game Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will enter different rooms; regardless of which path you choose, you will encounter various events along the way, all leading to the highest point</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/extras/\u968f\u673a\u5730\u56fe\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c_1280_720.gif?t=1742539536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rewards for Each Round</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each battle, based on the characteristics of the weapons and the passives already in your inventory, select a weapon to add to your arsenal to boost your character\u2019s strength and increase the game difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/extras/\u6b66\u5668\u9009\u62e9\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c_1920_1080.gif?t=1742539536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, you will face various random events that force you to make choices, each of which will affect your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/extras/\u4e8b\u4ef6\u7cfb\u7edf\u2014\u2014\u4f7f\u7528Clipchamp\u5236\u4f5c_1280_720.gif?t=1742539536\" /></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206150?t=1742539536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206150?t=1742539536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/5aa99a7b24ce19e9d0ffeff17062ac1a8858278f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742539536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206150/5aa99a7b24ce19e9d0ffeff17062ac1a8858278f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742539536","ca